doc.add_paragraph('Reference convention: p. means the printed manuscript page; PDF p. counts from the title page in the supplied paginated study copy. Paragraphs count nonempty Word paragraphs starting on that page, including headings, list entries and table cells. A paragraph continuing from a previous page is referenced at its starting page. These references describe the downloaded Word export as rendered on 23 October 2026; Google Docs pagination may differ. They are study references, not ICF locations.')
groups=[items[i:i+5] for i in range(0,len(items),5)]
offset=0
for group in groups:
    doc.add_page_break()
    doc.add_paragraph('Proposed responses to Form 4B','Heading 1')
    doc.add_paragraph('For every Pending ICF item: YES remains unverified; actual ICF page and paragraph must be added after finalization. The headings below summarize the corresponding numbered form elements.')
    for label,status,answer in group:
        offset+=1
        doc.add_paragraph(f'{offset}  {label}','Heading 2')
        p=doc.add_paragraph(); p.add_run(status+'. ').bold=True; p.add_run(answer)
        p=doc.add_paragraph(); p.add_run('Study reference: ').bold=True; p.add_run(refs[offset])

doc.add_page_break()
doc.add_paragraph('Actions before completing the official checklist','Heading 1')
for text in [
'Resolve the historical-control comparison versus the stated limits on retention-outcome research, and use the same final procedures throughout the protocol and ICF.',
'Confirm the PI, all participant groups and counts, usability-session duration, recording arrangements, eligibility criteria and whether any students are minors. If minors are included, obtain REC direction on parental permission and assent.',
'Finalize a participant-facing ICF with role-specific procedures, voluntary participation, record-use authorization, risks, costs, payments, harm arrangements, contacts and privacy provisions. Explain the language and consent process so participants can understand and ask questions.',
'Confirm the provenance of the 1,000 records, unique data-subject count, institutional authorization and consent or approved waiver for research/model training. Institutional permission and individual consent serve different purposes.',
'Address and verify public student-data access and the trusted-header authentication fallback before using identifiable participant data. This was a source-code review, not a live security test. Role checks and token support alone do not establish effective protection on every route.',
'Approve the retention and deletion schedule, authorized research recipients, handling of health-related responses and withdrawal limits. Account for exports, email invitations, backups and model artifacts.',
'After finalizing and paginating the ICF, enter its actual page and paragraph for each applicable item and mark YES only where the element is present. Confirm provisional N/A judgments with the PI/REC. Leave reviewer decisions and signatures to the reviewers.'
]: doc.add_paragraph(text,style='List Number')
